sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Client
    participant W as Waiting room
    participant B as Booking service
    participant I as Seat inventory DB
    participant P as Payment service
    U->>W: join queue for event E
    W-->>U: signed queue token with position
    loop every few seconds
        U->>W: poll position
        W-->>U: position, or admitted token with 5 minute validity
    end
    U->>B: POST /events/E/holds with admitted token, seat ids, Idempotency-Key
    B->>B: verify token signature, event id and expiry
    B->>I: UPDATE seat SET status = HELD, hold_id = ?, hold_expires_at = ? WHERE event_id = E AND seat_id IN (...) AND status = AVAILABLE
    I-->>B: affected rows
    alt affected rows equals requested seats
        B-->>U: 201 hold with expiry
        U->>B: POST /holds/id/pay
        B->>P: authorize and capture, idempotency key = hold_id
        P-->>B: captured
        B->>I: UPDATE seat SET status = SOLD WHERE hold_id = ?
        B-->>U: 200 tickets issued
    else fewer rows
        B->>I: ROLLBACK
        B-->>U: 409 some seats already taken, with fresh availability
    end
